name: Mobile money
tagline: "Wallet, agent, bank and partner controls over synthetic mobile-money feeds - two Reconciliations, seven per-entity typologies and an agent Risk Score"
description: "A mobile-money industry pack over five synthetic feeds (wallet-platform ledger, trust-account bank statement, partner settlement file, wallet register and core-network subscriber snapshots). Needs the Professional or Enterprise edition: it carries Alert Rules, two Reconciliations (wallet vs bank float, wallet vs partner settlement) a Risk Score (Scoring & Lists) and an Anomaly Model (Anomaly Detection). Seven sql.template Jobs run daily over the previous day: commission over / under-pay, fee mis-charge, agent split transactions under the reporting limit, agent round-tripping, dormant-wallet reactivation, KYC tier-limit breach and wallet-vs-core provisioning mismatch, each with a per-entity Alert Rule keyed on the offender. The per-agent Risk Score combines split, round-trip and commission signals; its Alert Rule is created after the score's first run. The wallet-activity Anomaly Model compares each wallet's daily transaction count and value with its own history and with wallets of the same KYC tier; its Alert Rule is likewise created after the model's first run. Every threshold and rate is configuration. The synthetic golden corpus lands in data/samples - copy each feed into data/inbox/<feed> to ingest. Runbooks: config/runbooks/mobile-money-runbooks.md."
icon: heroicons_outline:device-phone-mobile
contents[9]: "5 Pipelines + schemas", "2 Reconciliations (bank float, partner settlement)", "7 detection Jobs (sql.template)", "7 per-entity Alert Rules", "Agent Risk Score + pending high-risk Alert Rule", "Wallet-activity Anomaly Model + pending unusual-activity Alert Rule", "4 KPIs", "Dashboard", "Runbooks"
